<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/jarrett-allen/#faq","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/jarrett-allen/"},"mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Is Jarrett Allen Paid in 2026-27?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Allen earns $28m in 2026-27, fourth at Cleveland and the first year of his extension. It rises from $20m, which is what he was paid in each of the last five seasons. His career earnings reach $138.03m across ten seasons. The salary is 13.54% of the club’s $206.73m payroll."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What’s Next for Jarrett Allen Beyond 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Two seasons remain after this one, worth about $62.72m between them and all of it guaranteed. He reaches unrestricted free agency in 2029 at 31."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Does Jarrett Allen Earn Over Time?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A $28m season is hard to picture, so here's what it comes to over smaller stretches of time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"When Does Jarrett Allen’s Contract Expire?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Allen signed a three-year extension worth $90.72m with Cleveland in 2024 under Bird rights, fully guaranteed, and it starts this season. There are no options in it. He becomes an unrestricted free agent in 2029 at 31."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Is Jarrett Allen’s Net Worth Today?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Allen’s net worth is estimated at around $55.21m, taken from his $138.03m in career earnings. No outlet publishes a figure for him. He played one season at Texas and Brooklyn took him 22nd in 2017, two months after he turned 19. He has been at Cleveland since January 2021."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why Is Jarrett Allen Paid $28m on His Extension?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Allen is paid $28m because a center who rebounds and finishes at the rim holds his value into his late twenties, and Cleveland extended him a year early to avoid the market. Cleveland has now paid him $131.91m of his $138.03m career total."}}]}</script>
